\"size16\">Github Actions로 gh-pages 자동 배포하기</p>\n<p class=\"og-desc\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">gh-pages, github actions, 자동 배포 이야기</p>\n<p class=\"og-host\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">velog.io</p>\n</div>\n</a></figure>\n<p data-ke-size=\"size16\"><a href=\"https://joeyhwang.tistory.com/19\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener&nbsp;noreferrer\">https://joeyhwang.tistory.com/19</a></p>\n<figure id=\"og_1726636497577\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"article\" data-og-title=\"GitHub : Flutter Web app을 GitHub Pages를 이용해 Deploy하기 1/2\" data-og-description=\"Flutter 에서 만든 App은 Windows, Linux, Mac OS, Android, iOS, Web 등 다양한 방식으로 Build, Release 가능합니다. 타 플랫폼에서 사용하는 App의 경우, 해당 플랫폼용 설치 파일 포맷이나 실행 파일로 배포하면 \" data-og-host=\"joeyhwang.tistory.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://joeyhwang.tistory.com/19\" data-og-url=\"https://joeyhwang.tistory.com/19\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/44wmW/hyW2Uvg3Sw/oFToyCUCfrph1gBiyZUKuK/img.png?width=800&amp;height=498&amp;face=0_0_800_498,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cKzDrt/hyW6KqZTYl/ae4UMhXxE4s0fWZqzykitK/img.png?width=800&amp;height=498&amp;face=0_0_800_498,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/byJQBD/hyW6E5nggv/kdSrJdfJGc6sLBQTJ6MsU1/img.png?width=1920&amp;height=1008&amp;face=0_0_1920_1008\"><a href=\"https://joeyhwang.tistory.com/19\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-source-url=\"https://joeyhwang.tistory.com/19\">\n<div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image: url('https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/44wmW/hyW2Uvg3Sw/oFToyCUCfrph1gBiyZUKuK/img.png?width=800&amp;height=498&amp;face=0_0_800_498,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cKzDrt/hyW6KqZTYl/ae4UMhXxE4s0fWZqzykitK/img.png?width=800&amp;height=498&amp;face=0_0_800_498,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/byJQBD/hyW6E5nggv/kdSrJdfJGc6sLBQTJ6MsU1/img.png?width=1920&amp;height=1008&amp;face=0_0_1920_1008');\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"og-text\">\n<p class=\"og-title\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">GitHub : Flutter Web app을 GitHub 